{
  "_comment": [
    "Found-substance crosswalk for the drug-checking 'What's in the Sample?' visual (a maintained asset,",
    "read by data_viz/drugcheck_substances.py). groups: display order = file order; each group's",
    "`substances` maps a display label to the normalized tokens (data_viz.drugcheck_substances.norm_substance:",
    "accents stripped, lower-cased, alphanumerics only) of every spelling the sites have entered for it in",
    "an FTIR column. strips: internal strip column -> [group, label] credited on a Positive/Positif reading.",
    "ignore: FTIR tokens that identify nothing. category_fallback: normalized source FTIR-category token ->",
    "group for a spelling this file doesn't list yet (it keeps its raw label and gen-visuals prints it).",
    "After each new drugChecking cycle: run `make gen-visuals`, read the 'unmapped FTIR' warning, add the",
    "new spellings here (tests/unit/test_drugcheck_substances.py pins the current vocabulary)."
  ],
